          <p class="hero-eyebrow">CVE-2026-114938</p>
          <h1 class="hero-title">Java4Shell</h1>
          <p class="hero-tagline">Write once, RCE everywhere</p>
          <p class="hero-byline">Story by <a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/us/politics/ai-security-bug-java.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the New York Times</a></p>
          <p class="hero-dek">A memory-corruption vulnerability in OpenJDK's Base64 decoder. A remote attacker with no credentials can overwrite heap memory, read it in the style of Heartbleed, and reach remote code execution.</p>
